      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-254",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-255",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "pre: \"Why Here\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-256",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "preColor: \"text-[#007c7e]\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-257",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "title: \"Why this can go further on York Road\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-258",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "titleColor: \"text-[#2c324e]\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-259",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-260",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A dense corridor with clear demand for neighborhood-serving retail and services."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-261",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Belvedere Square** is a success story right on York Road—proof that community-centered development can thrive here."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-262",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Residents want ownership—not just input—over what gets built next."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-263",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-264",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A loader turns this into `{ kind: 'copy', data: { … }, paragraphs: [...] }`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-265",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-271",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-266",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Component-First:** Every `kind` maps to a real Vue block in `app/components/blocks/...`. The registry enforces a stable interface and isolates content from implementation."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-267",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Design System Integration:** `theme.tokens` become CSS variables (Style Dictionary) and can be overridden per story. `actions: theme.setToken` is allowed at runtime for live preview."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-268",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Form-Driven Configuration:** Each `kind` can export a `form.yaml` (optional) to expose author-editable props in your viewer; the DSL becomes the default fixture."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-269",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Live Preview & Testing:** The compiled `SceneSpec[]` renders in your `/blocks` viewer. Device frames, skeletons, and persistence come from your existing viewer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-270",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**DX:** Story files live under `app/storytime/` (or `content/stories/`) and are validated via Zod + ESLint. CI can fail on invalid references, missing assets, or unknown `kind`s."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-272",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-273",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| `do` | Description | Args |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-274",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-275",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| `media.play` | Play a video/audio | — |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-276",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| `media.pause` | Pause media | — |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-277",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| `media.reset` | Reset media to 0 | — |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-278",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| `media.maybePlay` | Autoplay if allowed | — |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-279",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| `map.ensureVisible` | Fit/center active features | { padding?: number } |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-280",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| `map.setFocus` | Programmatically focus region/feature | { id?: string, bbox?: […] } |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-281",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| `viz.setRevealCount` | Reveal N slices/cards (waffle/tiles/etc.) | { count: number } |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-282",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| `theme.setToken` | Override a token during scene lifetime | { name: string, value: any } |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-283",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "All are opt-in and implemented in the registry. No inline JS."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-284",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-285",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-286",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// dsl/compile.ts"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-287",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import type { StoryDoc } from './types';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-288",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import type { SceneSpec } from '@/types/scene-spec';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-289",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export function compileStory(doc: StoryDoc, registry: KindRegistry): SceneSpec[] {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-290",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// 1) Resolve ${vars} in assets/props recursively"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-291",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// 2) Validate against Zod schemas (nice errors)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-292",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// 3) Map visual.kind → component, adapt props"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-293",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// 4) Map articles → {component, componentProps} or {html}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-294",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// 5) Convert offsets/triggers to your viewer’s expected fields"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-295",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// 6) Wire actions into your controller (enter/exit/step)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-296",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// 7) Return SceneSpec[]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-297",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "return [];"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-298",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-299",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-300",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You already have most of the runtime; this keeps it stable while giving authors a higher-level surface."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-301",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-302",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```yaml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-304",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-303",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "key: neighbors-unite"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-305",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "visual:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-306",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "kind: video.hero"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-307",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "ref: who"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-308",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "props:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-309",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "src: \"${whoVideo}\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-310",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "controls: true"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-311",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "tracks: [{ src: \"${whoVtt}\", kind: captions, srclang: en, label: English, default: true }]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-312",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "animatedCaptions: { jsonUrl: \"${whoJson}\", mode: word, textShadow: true, maxCharsPerGroup: 25 }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-313",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "actions:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-314",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- { on: enter, do: media.maybePlay, target: \"@who\" }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-315",
      "type": "paragraph",
